WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.313
- (laughing) I am so excited by it.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:06.357
Now, it's time for the
straight shooter to deliver.

00:00:06.357 --> 00:00:07.190
(audience cheers)

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.820
We have Stephen A. Smith
on the line right now.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:10.558
What's up, Stephen? (laughs)

00:00:10.558 --> 00:00:14.147
(audience cheering)

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:16.261
- Hi, Kelly. How are you?

00:00:16.261 --> 00:00:18.270
- (laughing) Oh my god.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:19.350
That's what your face looked like

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.570
when we were in the suite. (laughs)

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:23.010
So, by coincidence-

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:23.970
- It's unbelievable.

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:24.803
- I can't even...

00:00:24.803 --> 00:00:26.910
Can you even believe, when
you walked in the suite?

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:29.790
I was like, "We're in
the same suite? What?"

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:30.623
They put us in the same suite-
- [Stephen] I know.

00:00:30.623 --> 00:00:32.490
- at the Super Bowl, and...

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.280
I know, oh my god. So freaking funny.

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.260
So, you... Were you freaking out?

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.790
As that game clock was winding down?

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:39.990
Yeah, and I was looking
at you like, "Ohhh!"

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.673
- I was, I was.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.460
I thought the Eagles had 'em.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:48.090
I mean, they still went up
24 to 14 in the first half.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:48.987
I was was like-
- [Kelly] I know.

00:00:48.987 --> 00:00:49.820
- This is good.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:50.666
I'm a have Kelly Clarkson

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:52.369
singin' a song to me.
(Kelly laughs and claps)

00:00:52.369 --> 00:00:53.700
I mean, this is beautiful.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.300
And the next thing I know, you
know, everything fell apart.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.520
You know, I didn't expect that.

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.170
It kind of caught me by surprise.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:02.490
But, it's all right.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.290
I mean, you got the best of me.

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:05.760
I mean, it's embarrassing.

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:08.730
I mean, I'm a sports
analyst losing sports bet

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.045
to a premier singer and talk show host.

00:01:11.045 --> 00:01:11.880
(Kelly clapping)

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.640
But you know, I mean, these
kind of things happen.

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:16.033
- Thanks, you're amazing.
- I just have to deal with it.

00:01:16.033 --> 00:01:17.100
I have to take it.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:17.940
- Oh, my god!

00:01:17.940 --> 00:01:19.200
I gotta be honest with you,

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.570
no one I know saw that coming,

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:23.490
but I will tell you, my favorite part

00:01:23.490 --> 00:01:25.260
of the entire Super Bowl, even topping...

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.300
'Cause I loved Rihanna and Stapleton,

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:28.740
Babyface, everybody, Sheryl Lee,

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:30.120
everybody did such a great job, that...

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.380
The players, everybody.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.470
But my favorite part of the Super Bowl

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.620
was turning around and
looking at you, (laughs)

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.532
right before the Chiefs won. (laughing)

00:01:40.532 --> 00:01:41.365
(audience laughs)

00:01:41.365 --> 00:01:43.350
I mean, it was, it felt so good,

00:01:43.350 --> 00:01:45.210
and I just couldn't
stop laughing about it.

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.043
I was like,

00:01:46.043 --> 00:01:47.940
"I don't know how this is
happening, but I'm so happy."

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.220
And is there anything else,
though, you want to say

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:54.480
before you announce your
new favorite team? (laughs)

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.502
- I'm not announcing a new favorite team!

00:01:56.502 --> 00:01:57.335
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:01:57.335 --> 00:02:00.510
That is not the bet we had.
That is not the bet we had.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:01.740
The Dallas Cowboys...

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:03.570
No, I'm not doing it, Kelly.

00:02:03.570 --> 00:02:04.733
- I don't remember it this way.

00:02:04.733 --> 00:02:05.566
- [Stephen] But I will say this.

00:02:05.566 --> 00:02:06.399
- I don't remember it this way.

00:02:06.399 --> 00:02:08.840
- I will say this. I...

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:11.430
- [Kelly] Get it out!

00:02:11.430 --> 00:02:13.616
- Hold on, hold on.
(Kelly clapping)

00:02:13.616 --> 00:02:14.449
I...

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:16.500
I love the Cowboys!

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.737
- Oh my god!
(audience cheers)

00:02:18.737 --> 00:02:19.887
- I said it, okay?

00:02:19.887 --> 00:02:22.072
- You heard it here!
- I said it, all right?

00:02:22.072 --> 00:02:24.797
(both laughing)

00:02:24.797 --> 00:02:25.630
- Oh my god.

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:28.170
Oh my god, I love you so much.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:30.660
Hey, you owned it, and you did it.

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:32.040
You followed through with the bet.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.480
That's a man of your
word, I'm just saying.

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:36.029
Cowboys lover: Stephen
A. Smith, everybody!

00:02:36.029 --> 00:02:37.785
(audience cheering)

